                                                "sense_id": "efe889c5-8e63-35bd-a509-15a1abf316d6",
                                                "text": "They felt that the fellow was a quockerwodger rather than a politician, an againster rather than a true American, an oppositionist in fundamental things rather than a sincere patriot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "367be9fb-8f69-4731-b58d-9f43d2345016",
